From 8fbf257cc56b054864cc7df019fe07e1808bbb55 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: JohnSnow <110465696+JohnSnow14284@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 20 Jul 2026 21:40:30 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 06/23] Add distant beacon LOD rendering

Introduce lightweight LOD rendering for vanilla beacon beams by caching resolved beacon beam sections and rendering small static meshes beyond the BER distance. Adds DistantBeaconRenderer, a mixin to capture beacon ticks and state changes, shader support for a solid beacon variant, and integration with the LOD pipeline and NeoForge event bus. Adds a configurable toggle (distantBeaconBeams) with menu and NeoForge config wiring, language entries, and mixins registration. Includes LRU cache, safe error handling and fallbacks so functionality is optional and non-fatal on failures.
